Package: restlos-air
Version: 1.7.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jurkast <312310339+jurkast@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jurkast/restlos-air
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-cairo, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-secret-1, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, iputils-ping, iproute2, pulseaudio-utils, coolercontrold (>= 5.0.1)
Description: Native cooling controls and gaming widget for Linux
 Restlos Air combines local hardware temperatures, fan controls through the
 existing CoolerControl daemon, and a compact desktop widget with a tray icon.
 It uses GTK 3 and does not install a second hardware control daemon.
